---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description={`Why ${SITE.name} exists, how the data is verified, and who builds it.`}
>
  <article class="max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">About {SITE.name}</h1>

    <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        {SITE.name} is an independent toolkit for developers working with large language models. It exists because the
        two questions every AI builder asks — <em>“how many tokens is this?”</em> and <em>“what will this actually cost
        me?”</em> — deserve answers that are free, private, and honest about their data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Our data policy</h2>
      <p>
        Pricing data goes stale fast in this industry. That is why every model row on this site carries its own
        <span class="font-mono text-sm"> lastChecked</span> date and source link. We verify against official provider
        pricing pages on a fixed schedule, and we would rather show a dated number than a confident guess.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        All tools run 100% client-side in your browser. The text you paste into a token counter never leaves your
        machine — there is no backend that could receive it. See the <a href="/privacy" class="text-[#0F6B5C] underline">privacy policy</a> for details.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Independence</h2>
      <p>
        The site may earn referral commissions from tools reviewed or recommended. This never affects what data we
        publish: prices, benchmarks and comparisons follow the same verification process regardless of commercial
        relationships.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
